<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>工作堆積如山，不如先去釜山</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: "微軟正黑體", sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
    }

    header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff9a9e, #fad0c4);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      font-size: 26px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .container {
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .day {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .day h2 {
      color: #ff6f91;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
      gap: 15px;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 15px;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: black;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      transition: 0.3s;
    }

    .card:hover {
      transform: scale(1.03);
    }

    .card img {
      width: 100%;
      height: 160px;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .card-content {
      padding: 10px;
    }

    .card-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      color: #ff6f91;
    }

  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  工作堆積如山，不如先去釜山
</header>

<div class="container">

  <!-- Day 1 -->
  <div class="day">
    <h2>Day 1：📅 12/14 桃園機場 ✈ 金海機場</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=海雲台" target="_blank">
        <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?beach" />
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">🌊 海雲台海邊</div>
          <div>散步放空</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=釜山豬肉湯飯" target="_blank">
        <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?korean-food" />
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">🍜 豬肉湯飯</div>
          <div>必吃美食</div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Day 2 -->
  <div class="day">
    <h2>Day 2：甘川文化村</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=甘川文化村" target="_blank">
        <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?colorful-town" />
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">📸 甘川文化村</div>
          <div>拍照天堂</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="https://maps.google.com/?q=南浦洞" target="_blank">
        <img src="https://source.unsplash.com/400x300/?shopping-street" />
        <div class="card-content">
          <div class="card-title">🛍️ 南浦洞</div>
          <div>逛街購物</div>
        </div>
      </a>

    </div>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
